        <mxCell id="scope" value="SCOPE NOTES&#10;PHO = provincial administrator; RHU = assigned facility. Each action remains subject to controller checks.&#10;Midwife clinical access is limited to assigned patients; allocations require recipient ownership. RHU staff do not inherit administrator-only permissions.&#10;Public access requires no staff account. Disease case analysis and medicine stock forecasting are separate functions." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;strokeColor=#64748b;fillColor=#ffffff;shape=note;fillColor=#f8fafc;align=left;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
